        <briefdescription>
<para>Invokes the stored callable. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Always inlined, so that, without optimisations, it adds no frame between <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1callable__ref_1affde2e2f927df6b5ada7f5578f8d5c36" kindref="member">callable_ref::invoke_callable()</ref></computeroutput> and the callable.</para>
